": "76561198121992991", "personaname": "darkZx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/darkZx01/", "num_games_owned": 1028, "num_reviews": 108, "playtime_forever": 16, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16, "last_played": 1756841509, "avatar": "260bddb0b8ecb203ed46d7cca07c98fb5315b6ef"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1]🔴 Risk of Rain – Chaos, Loot, and Endless Waves[/h1]\r\n\r\nRisk of Rain is pure rogue-like chaos. You drop onto alien worlds with nothing, fight hordes of monsters, and scramble to collect loot that makes you stronger—until the difficulty curve catches up and things spiral into absolute madness. The tension of each run, combined with the thrill of discovering new items, keeps you hooked.\r\n\r\nThe game shines in co-op. Playing with friends turns every run into a frantic, chaotic adventure where teamwork is key, and laughing at ridiculous deaths is half the fun. Even solo, it’s punishing but rewarding, forcing you to adapt and strategize with every attempt.\r\n\r\nIt’s simple in mechanics but deep in strategy, and the pixel art style is charming while still delivering intense, fast-paced action. Risk of Rain is a perfect storm of loot, chaos, and replayability.\r\n\r\n[h1]Score: 8.8/10[/h1]", "timestamp_created": 1756928405, "timestamp_updated": 1756928405, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454545468091964722", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203382335", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072403328", "personaname": "Wraith", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ID56068800/", "num_games_owned": 2161, "num_reviews": 102, "playtime_forever": 1388, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1388, "last_played": 